# Training artefacts. Both are reproducible from the scripts in the package
# and MUST be regenerated whenever reba.py changes, since reba.py is the
# teacher that labels the dataset. Committing them invites a stale model
# scoring postures with rules the code no longer uses.
#   python3 generate_deba_dataset.py
#   python3 train_deba_model.py
deba_dataset/
*.pth
*.npz
